<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#AsciiNumericWidthShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reusable validation contract for Ascii Numeric Width. A bddo:asciiInteger / bddo:asciiDecimal field must declare a width (size / sizeFromField / sizeFromExpression) or a terminator."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#AsciiNumericWidthShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Validation activation: instances of bddo:Field Constraints apply only within that activation or through shape references; they are not global OWL domain axioms."@en .
