<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#DataTypeRuleShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo> .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#DataTypeShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reusable validation contract for bddo:baseType, bddo:bitWidth, bddo:endianness, bddo:isSigned, bddo:xsdType. Its constraints below specify the permitted values and combinations."@en .
