<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#string> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Variable-length primitive text datatype; its byte extent and character encoding are supplied by the field/profile."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#string> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use in physical binary-format descriptions. Extents and offsets describe bytes unless a term explicitly specifies bits; HEL evaluation and failure behavior follow the processing specification. Use this IRI as a controlled value where the profile or a shape accepts its declared type."@en .
